APEX BROWSER — PHASE 4B

Secure Credential Vault & Authorized Credential-Based Automation

PROJECT CONTEXT

You are working on Apex Browser, an Android browser built using Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, Android WebView, Room, ViewModel, and Repository architecture.

GitHub repository:
