PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Implement Phase 4B: Secure Credential Vault & Authorized Credential-Based Automation.

Currently, Phase 4A prevents password values from being recorded. However, users still need a secure way to provide credentials when replaying workflows that contain login or other authentication forms.

We need to introduce a secure, locally stored credential vault that allows users to save credentials themselves, associate them with website origins, and explicitly authorize automation to use those credentials during replay.

The credential vault must be independent of the automation workflow database.

The automation workflow must never contain a plaintext password.

The browser must never collect, extract, or save passwords without the user's explicit action.

This feature must work without external AI APIs.

